    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARMA is a retro dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilding game featuring a story-driven campaign.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Grim Tale of Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knights who returned from their expedition began slaughtering their own people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the day the kingdom burned and everything was lost, you were left standing alone in the heart of the tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world filled with betrayal and despair, uncover the truth and stand against the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/562241277878c4401a703bf3a6894d79.poster.webp?t=1753802146\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/562241277878c4401a703bf3a6894d79.webp?t=1753802146\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique and Strategic Battles through the Artifact System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Harma\u2019s battles, the power of your cards is determined randomly based on the activation of three artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you can spend Focus to forcefully activate artifacts and take control of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you leave it to chance, or will you risk it all with decisive focus?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice will completely alter the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine two playable characters with over 300 unique cards and artifacts to forge your own deck and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/aa8415ec3f24b4f920048cb75105add4.poster.webp?t=1753802146\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/aa8415ec3f24b4f920048cb75105add4.webp?t=1753802146\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harma\u2019s campaign unfolds across four epic acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the fall of the world and the fate of Eden firsthand through dynamic battles, branching dialogues, and cinematic cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/b795b18b88e7a64539aa0c76a01e1481.poster.webp?t=1753802146\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/b795b18b88e7a64539aa0c76a01e1481.webp?t=1753802146\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dimensional Rift</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you seek pure combat and strategy beyond the story, challenge yourself in the Dimensional Rift mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this endlessly replayable mode, you will face relentless battles without cinematic storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on ever-changing challenges and push your limits to the extreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/6cb4a57cfe06c43269063cdb53f6ef09.poster.webp?t=1753802146\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/6cb4a57cfe06c43269063cdb53f6ef09.webp?t=1753802146\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARMA is a retro dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilding game featuring a story-driven campaign.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Grim Tale of Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knights who returned from their expedition began slaughtering their own people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the day the kingdom burned and everything was lost, you were left standing alone in the heart of the tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world filled with betrayal and despair, uncover the truth and stand against the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/562241277878c4401a703bf3a6894d79.poster.webp?t=1753802146\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/562241277878c4401a703bf3a6894d79.webp?t=1753802146\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique and Strategic Battles through the Artifact System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Harma\u2019s battles, the power of your cards is determined randomly based on the activation of three artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you can spend Focus to forcefully activate artifacts and take control of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you leave it to chance, or will you risk it all with decisive focus?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice will completely alter the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine two playable characters with over 300 unique cards and artifacts to forge your own deck and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/aa8415ec3f24b4f920048cb75105add4.poster.webp?t=1753802146\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/aa8415ec3f24b4f920048cb75105add4.webp?t=1753802146\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harma\u2019s campaign unfolds across four epic acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the fall of the world and the fate of Eden firsthand through dynamic battles, branching dialogues, and cinematic cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/b795b18b88e7a64539aa0c76a01e1481.poster.webp?t=1753802146\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/b795b18b88e7a64539aa0c76a01e1481.webp?t=1753802146\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dimensional Rift</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you seek pure combat and strategy beyond the story, challenge yourself in the Dimensional Rift mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this endlessly replayable mode, you will face relentless battles without cinematic storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on ever-changing challenges and push your limits to the extreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/6cb4a57cfe06c43269063cdb53f6ef09.poster.webp?t=1753802146\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483700/extras/6cb4a57cfe06c43269063cdb53f6ef09.webp?t=1753802146\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>",
    "short_description": "HARMA is a retro dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilding game featuring a story-driven campaign. Uncover the truth behind the fallen knights, the burning kingdom, and your missing father. Harness the power of mighty artifacts to defeat demons and save a world on the brink of destruction.",
